onditions: risk score >50, holding Gold, having 'De-risking' rebalancing action, and having an underfunded goal (shortfall >0). Each condition maps to a filter on the respective class. The base entity is Investor, connected via investorId to PortfolioHealth, PortfolioHolding, RebalancingAction, and InvestmentGoal. All joins are inner to require all conditions. No measures or grouping needed.", "structural_repairs": [], "contract_errors": [], "contract_warnings": []}, "generated_sparql": "PREFIX wm: <https://wealth.example.org/ontology/>
